<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div><font face="arial">Hi&nbsp;{!Lead.FirstName}</font><span style="font-family: arial;">:</span></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">A quick thank you for your interest in our team. The next step after you've had a chance to review our site is to scheduling a one:one conversation. In order to align our busy schedules efficiently CLICK HERE to set a time.&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">We have a more personable approach than most so it's only fair to set proper expectations prior to our call. During our conversation, we are going to explore:</font></div><div><font face="arial">&nbsp;- What your objectives are,&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial">- Your resources, your plan, &amp;&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial">- How we may or may not fit in "your unique blueprint."&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">After, we will decide our next action steps with an accountable deadline to get the results you are looking for. Fair enough?&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">Looking forward to our conversation&nbsp;{!Lead.FirstName}</font><span style="font-family: arial;">!</span></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">Respectfully,</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">Amanda Holbrook &amp; Eric Anthos</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><span style="font-size: 12.8px; font-family: arial; color: rgb(51, 102, 102); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><b>Amanda Holbrook</b></span><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 12.8px; font-family: arial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="font-size: 12.8px; font-family: arial; color: rgb(51, 102, 102); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><i>Senior Portfolio Advisor&nbsp;</i></span><div style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); fo